    {
      "beat_id": "B01B",
      "act": "Why This Matters",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "estimated_duration_s": 20.0,
      "narration_text": "Hi, I'm Asavari, a fellow at Humanitarians AI. This video is about how the SEC Filings agent turns a ticker into verified financial metrics, end to end, from finding the company, to reading its official filing, to normalizing the numbers, to checking them. You'll see the whole pipeline, and why every step is built to be exact and repeatable. If you rely on automated financial data, this is for you.",
